<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Magnum Hunter started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Magnum Hunter started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>BT Securities said it initiated coverage of Magnum Hunter Resources Inc with a buy rating and a 12-month price target of 7-7/8.</p>
<p>-- stock was up 1/16 to 6-1/8.</p>
